<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Beach Song - Demo</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Leonie Biney</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Beach Song (Demo)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2TQEizKBJTJNJ1mHYxG6j7</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">5 Contributors</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Beach song (Demo) Lyrics</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 1]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I think we're drifting</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I know you feel it too</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Waves in the ocean</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Pray they float me right back to you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">When did it happen?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">When was the last time this would feel like old times?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">So why can't we</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Just take our time?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Lay on the beach</p><p ttm:agent="v1">For one more night?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">'Cause we're changing</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And that's alright</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But why can't we</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Just take our time?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 2]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I think it's ending</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I know you feel it too</p><p ttm:agent="v1">No use preventing</p><p ttm:agent="v1">What was already doomed</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But for a minute</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Even a second can we stay here?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Oh, right here?[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Why can't we</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Just takе our time?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Lay on the beach</p><p ttm:agent="v1">For onе more night?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">'Cause we're changing</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And that's alright</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But why can't we</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Just take our time?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Why can't we</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Just take our time?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Lay on the beach</p><p ttm:agent="v1">For one more night?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">'Cause we're changing</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And that's alright</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But why can't we</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Just take our time?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Outro]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Badadadoodum</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Badadadoodum, badadadum</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Badadadoodum</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Badadadoodum, badadadodadum</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Badadadoodum</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Badadadoodum, badadadum</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Badadadoodum</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Badadadoodum</p></div></body></tt>